Tom: Hi, I''d like to book two tickets for the Peking Opera on Saturday evening.
Clerk: Of course. Saturday''s show starts at seven o''clock. The seats near the front are forty pounds each.
Tom: That''s a bit too expensive for us. Do you have anything cheaper?
Clerk: We have seats at the back for twenty pounds. You can still see the stage clearly.
Tom: Great, I''ll take two of those, please.
Clerk: No problem. Please arrive ten minutes early, because the doors close once the show begins.
Tom: Thank you. We''re really looking forward to it.', 'Tom 打电话到城市剧院售票处,想订周六晚上京剧的两张票;周六演出7点开始,前排每张40英镑,太贵;售票员推荐后排每张20英镑、仍能看清舞台;Tom 订了两张后排票;售票员提醒提前十分钟到,因为开演后就关门;Tom 表示很期待。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Tom want to book?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Two tickets for the Peking Opera.","Three tickets for a comedy.","A table at a restaurant.","A room in a hotel."]},{"q":"When does Saturday''s show start?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["At six o''clock.","At seven o''clock.","At ten o''clock.","At noon."]},{"q":"Why doesn''t Tom choose the front seats?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["They are too expensive for him.","They are already sold out.","They are too far from the stage.","They are only for members."]},{"q":"How much does each back seat cost?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Forty pounds.","Twenty pounds.","Ten pounds.","Fifty pounds."]},{"q":"Why should Tom arrive early?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The tickets are not yet printed.","He has to cook dinner first.","The doors close once the show begins.","The theatre is hard to find."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U4', 'fltrp');
Lily: How about that new talent show? Everyone at school is talking about it.
Mum: I''m not really a fan of talent shows. The judges talk too much.
Lily: Then what about a nature documentary? There''s one about leopards at eight.
Mum: That sounds lovely. I do enjoy learning about wild animals.
Lily: Great. We can watch the talent show later online if you don''t mind.
Mum: That''s fine. Let''s make some popcorn before the documentary starts.
Lily: Perfect. I''ll get the bowls.', '妈妈说今晚电视没什么好看,问 Lily 想看什么;Lily 提议看大家都在聊的新选秀节目;妈妈不太喜欢选秀,觉得评委话太多;Lily 改提议八点的豹子纪录片;妈妈说喜欢了解野生动物,欣然同意;Lily 说选秀可以晚点在网上看;妈妈提议开演前做点爆米花;Lily 去拿碗。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Lily first suggest watching?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A new talent show.","A football match.","A cooking programme.","The evening news."]},{"q":"Why doesn''t Mum like talent shows?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["They are always too short.","She thinks the judges talk too much.","They have no music.","They start too late."]},{"q":"What will they watch at eight o''clock?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A romantic film.","A comedy show.","A documentary about leopards.","A talk show."]},{"q":"How will Lily watch the talent show?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["On the big screen now.","At a friend''s house.","She has decided not to.","Online later."]},{"q":"What do they plan to make before the programme?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Some popcorn.","A cup of tea.","A birthday cake.","A big dinner."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U4', 'fltrp');
Ben: I''d love to! But Manchester is quite far. How are we going to get there?
Anna: I''ve already made all the arrangements. We''ll take the morning train from London.
Ben: Good idea. Trains are faster than coaches. What time does it leave?
Anna: At nine, so we should meet at the station by half past eight.
Ben: Where are we staying for the night?
Anna: I''ve booked a small hotel near the concert hall, so we can walk there easily.
Ben: You''ve thought of everything. I can''t wait!', 'Anna 有两张下周六曼彻斯特演唱会的票,邀请 Ben 同去;Ben 很想去,但担心曼彻斯特远,怎么去;Anna 说已安排好,坐早上从伦敦出发的火车;Ben 赞同,火车比长途车快,问几点出发;Anna 说九点,所以八点半在车站碰头;Ben 问晚上住哪;Anna 已在音乐厅附近订了小旅馆,步行即到;Ben 称赞她想得周到,十分期待。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Where is the concert?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["In London.","In Glasgow.","In Manchester.","In Liverpool."]},{"q":"How will they travel there?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["By coach.","By plane.","By bicycle.","By train."]},{"q":"What time will they meet at the station?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["At half past eight.","At nine o''clock.","At seven o''clock.","At ten o''clock."]},{"q":"Where will they stay for the night?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["At Anna''s cousin''s house.","In a small hotel near the concert hall.","On the night train.","In a tent by the river."]},{"q":"What does Ben think of Anna''s planning?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["She has forgotten the tickets.","She has chosen the wrong city.","She has thought of everything.","She has booked too late."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required2', 'U4', 'fltrp');

